Z||000012||Cliff Pennock||09-29-1999||12:01 PM||||Wouldn't it be nice if making your Fiero go faster would be just as easy? (notice my pathetic attempts to keep this Fiero-related?)<P>Patrick: my C366 runs stable @ 550/2.0V. If I enable the turbo option it'll only go to 556 but it will not boot then. I'm content though with 550!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Batboy: I've seldomly heared of a 300A go over 450, but it could be that any of your plug-in cards don't like the non-standard (over 66) busspeed.<P>(Ok, I got the words <I>Fiero</I>, <I>Turbo</I> and <I>Speed</I> in one message - now I don't have to kick myself of the forum!)||||reg||1
